{"id":"wb-5-371","name":"东华里古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"东华里古建筑群","text":"东华里古建筑群位于中国广东省佛山市禅城区祖庙街道福贤路，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n东华里原称“杨伍街”，因清初此地主要为杨氏和伍氏聚居而得名，后两族逐渐衰落，于乾隆年间改称现名。东华里嘉庆、道光年间迁入骆氏，清末又迁入招氏，经多次维修改造形成现貌。东华里主路长112米，建筑群占地6700平方米，是广东省保存最完整的珠三角风格民居建筑群。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%9C%E5%8D%8E%E9%87%8C%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":93169237,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93169237","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/42cb22aaeb06b56e22985553.jpg","title":"佛山东华里入口_2025.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BD%9B%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%9C%E5%8D%8E%E9%87%8C%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3_2025.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/%E4%BD%9B%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%9C%E5%8D%8E%E9%87%8C%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3_2025.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"PÑēüḾôňïę1357","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​佛山东华里古建筑群入口","width":320,"height":427}}